# yin.vm.linker M4 slice S3: require lowering and the install child

S3 is done except the private `:resources` table and the sealed references built on it, which need files outside this slice's allowed set. `(require 'foo)` now links, installs as a child task, and resumes with the module's exports, on all four backends. JVM and Node are both green. The Dart lane was not run, as instructed. Nothing is committed or staged. The full report is at `/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/collab/1790416871816-vm-engineer-linker-m4-s3-require-install.claude-opus-5-5.report.md`.

